WEBVTT

00:01.481 --> 00:02.818
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.842 --> 00:04.177
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.201 --> 00:07.417
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.441 --> 00:13.001
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.001 --> 01:30.961
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.121 --> 01:34.361
=Episode 8=

01:38.641 --> 01:41.561
(Hong Xixiang
The youngest junior of Master of Wudang)

01:43.121 --> 01:46.561
(Wudang)

01:51.761 --> 01:52.441
(Wang Chonglou Master of Wudang Sect)
The Master of Wudang Sect

01:52.561 --> 01:54.441
came down the mountain to
welcome you in person.

01:54.640 --> 01:56.960
It appears Wudang and North Liang
have a good relationship.

02:08.640 --> 02:10.601
Greetings, Your Highness.

02:11.961 --> 02:12.961
Where is Huangman'er?

02:15.120 --> 02:16.120
Who left him here?

02:17.201 --> 02:18.201
Master.

02:25.561 --> 02:27.640
It must have been a long journey,
Mr. Chu.

02:28.040 --> 02:29.040
Greetings, Master Wang.

02:31.241 --> 02:32.241
And this is…

02:32.521 --> 02:33.921
The last disciple of my master,

02:34.040 --> 02:35.241
the youngest junior of mine.

02:35.441 --> 02:36.441
Hong Xixiang.

02:38.280 --> 02:39.617
He shares the same seniority with you?

02:39.641 --> 02:40.641
Exactly.

02:41.120 --> 02:42.241
If things don't go wrong,

02:42.400 --> 02:44.480
he'll be the next Master of Wudang.

02:44.840 --> 02:45.840
Hong Xixiang,

02:45.881 --> 02:47.617
don't you think you owed
the Xu family enough?

02:47.641 --> 02:49.536
That was what your father wanted.
What could I do?

02:49.560 --> 02:51.081
Mr. Chu is our guest.

02:51.200 --> 02:51.840
Junior,

02:51.961 --> 02:52.961
come and say hello.

02:54.641 --> 02:55.641
Mr. Chu.

02:55.961 --> 02:56.961
Good, good.

03:04.001 --> 03:05.001
Take me to him.

03:12.560 --> 03:13.560
Senior,

03:14.001 --> 03:15.561
how about you take them up
the mountain?

03:15.801 --> 03:16.961
You come with us.

03:17.721 --> 03:19.601
I'd like to herd the cattle
for a little longer.

03:19.680 --> 03:20.680
That's unimportant.

03:21.801 --> 03:22.320
Your Highness.

03:22.480 --> 03:23.520
Mr. Chu. This way, please.

03:28.920 --> 03:29.320
Come, come.

03:29.920 --> 03:30.920
Your Highness.

03:42.761 --> 03:43.761
Please.

03:47.961 --> 03:48.961
Your Highness, please.

04:07.361 --> 04:08.361
Brother.

04:09.361 --> 04:10.361
Brother.

04:11.680 --> 04:12.041
Brother.

04:12.400 --> 04:13.120
I was thinking of you,

04:13.280 --> 04:13.840
and here you are.

04:13.880 --> 04:14.880
Are you okay?

04:15.400 --> 04:16.400
I'm fine.

04:16.761 --> 04:17.841
Have you got your strength?

04:24.280 --> 04:25.280
I'm glad to know.

04:25.521 --> 04:25.840
Come.

04:25.921 --> 04:26.921
Come home with me.

04:28.361 --> 04:29.361
What?

04:30.081 --> 04:30.801
Father said,

04:31.041 --> 04:32.041
I can't go home.

04:32.521 --> 04:34.120
I say you can, and my word counts.

04:35.201 --> 04:36.201
But Father said,

04:36.400 --> 04:37.400
if I went home,

04:38.120 --> 04:39.321
I'd bring trouble to you.

04:39.680 --> 04:40.680
I don't mind any trouble.

04:41.560 --> 04:42.880
Don't be anxious, Your Highness.

04:43.280 --> 04:45.321
Calm yourself first.

04:46.840 --> 04:47.961
Are you trying to stop me?

04:50.081 --> 04:52.641
It's your family business.
How dare I stop you?

04:53.400 --> 04:55.521
I'm only suggesting you think clearly.

04:55.961 --> 04:58.041
After your little brother
goes back to North Liang,

04:58.280 --> 05:00.201
what would be waiting for him?

05:01.361 --> 05:02.361
I'll secure him.

05:02.481 --> 05:03.641
I won't allow him to be used.

05:04.600 --> 05:06.680
Can you stay by his side forever?

05:07.201 --> 05:08.201
Why can't I?

05:09.160 --> 05:10.280
Are you going to

05:10.321 --> 05:12.361
chain up your brother?

05:15.720 --> 05:18.321
I know your brotherly bond is strong,

05:19.120 --> 05:20.801
but have you ever thought

05:22.400 --> 05:24.120
what if the ones
who support your brother

05:24.361 --> 05:25.720
do something against you?

05:27.400 --> 05:28.400
I'll deal with them.

05:28.600 --> 05:30.120
What if the ones who support you

05:30.280 --> 05:31.640
do something against your brother?

05:32.041 --> 05:33.041
Who dare do it?

05:34.120 --> 05:36.880
In a power struggling,
anything is possible.

05:37.600 --> 05:38.840
If you take him home like this,

05:40.641 --> 05:41.761
you're pushing him

05:55.521 --> 05:58.280
You'd better think before you act.

06:01.040 --> 06:01.400
Come.

06:01.441 --> 06:02.441
Where are you taking him?

06:03.641 --> 06:05.480
I'll take him on a tour around Wudang.

06:13.360 --> 06:15.201
Before you make a decision,

06:15.480 --> 06:17.441
I won't do anything.

06:22.761 --> 06:23.761
I won't go.

06:23.920 --> 06:24.920
I'll just stay here.

06:31.240 --> 06:32.240
Come.

06:39.001 --> 06:40.561
I haven't visited Wudang for years.

06:41.441 --> 06:42.761
I'll take a look around.

07:13.121 --> 07:14.121
How about we

07:14.561 --> 07:15.561
sit and talk inside?

07:25.081 --> 07:27.361
(Purple Bamboo Forest)

07:32.441 --> 07:34.377
(Wang Xiaoping
No. 1 Swordsman of Wudang)

07:34.401 --> 07:35.840
What's on your mind, Your Highness?

07:39.240 --> 07:41.001
Did I upset my brother?

07:42.681 --> 07:43.681
Not you.

07:47.160 --> 07:48.961
But why did Father say

07:49.881 --> 07:50.921
it'd be bad for my brother

07:51.160 --> 07:52.160
if I went home?

07:54.201 --> 07:56.280
It's because your brother
isn't cruel enough.

07:57.001 --> 07:58.001
And that's not good?

07:59.720 --> 08:00.720
That is good.

08:01.040 --> 08:03.097
(Purple Bamboo Forest)
It's just the human world is like hell,

08:03.121 --> 08:04.840
and the soft-hearted gets hurt.

08:06.280 --> 08:07.280
I can protect him.

08:18.600 --> 08:19.600
Junior,

08:19.881 --> 08:21.441
how come you left Purple Bamboo Forest?

08:24.521 --> 08:26.081
This is the second son of His Lordship.

08:30.321 --> 08:31.321
A born talent.

08:31.800 --> 08:32.800
With a pure heart.

08:33.800 --> 08:34.800
Good.

08:37.641 --> 08:39.040
How about His Highness

08:39.480 --> 08:41.001
lives in the Purple Bamboo Forest?

08:45.201 --> 08:46.561
From the perspective of the heart,

08:47.121 --> 08:48.361
across the entire Mount Wudang,

08:50.160 --> 08:51.480
you're the one who

09:00.400 --> 09:01.400
Okay.

09:15.521 --> 09:17.480
I pretty much got it.

09:18.201 --> 09:21.201
Someone wanted to
steal the power from you

09:22.761 --> 09:24.201
using your brother

09:25.160 --> 09:26.280
as a pretext.

09:28.600 --> 09:30.400
I never wanted
the sovereignty of North Liang.

09:32.040 --> 09:33.200
How about you give it to him?

09:33.961 --> 09:35.400
Huangman'er has a pure heart

09:35.641 --> 09:36.641
and is unsophisticated.

09:37.521 --> 09:38.881
If I gave him North Liang,

09:39.720 --> 09:41.121
someday, those who support him

09:41.280 --> 09:42.681
would take his life.

09:44.720 --> 09:45.641
Then the result

09:45.720 --> 09:47.297
would be the same
as His Lordship predicts.

09:47.321 --> 09:48.480
There are only two options.

09:48.881 --> 09:50.961
One, your brother
never returns to North Liang again.

09:51.001 --> 09:52.720
Two, you wipe out all those

09:53.001 --> 09:54.041
ambitious men in the army.

09:54.641 --> 09:56.081
I must make a decision.

09:59.201 --> 10:01.081
But which person

10:02.040 --> 10:03.921
is behind your brother?

10:04.360 --> 10:05.480
He's too well-hidden.

10:06.681 --> 10:07.921
Even Xu Xiao couldn't find him.

10:10.720 --> 10:11.961
Well, that's easy.

10:12.201 --> 10:14.480
Now that your brother
can't return to North Liang,

10:14.961 --> 10:16.961
you keep him here in Wudang for now.

10:18.321 --> 10:20.720
If you miss him, you can come
and see him anytime you like.

10:22.561 --> 10:23.801
This is where the problem lies.

10:25.720 --> 10:26.720
Can Wudang

10:27.281 --> 10:28.281
secure him?

10:29.801 --> 10:30.961
It's a large sect.

10:31.561 --> 10:32.561
Surely we can secure him.

10:34.801 --> 10:36.121
You need to understand one thing.

10:36.880 --> 10:38.880
Those who support Huangman'er

10:40.201 --> 10:41.801
aren't necessarily the North Liang Army.

10:43.561 --> 10:44.561
Who are they, then?

10:45.640 --> 10:47.480
Who wants North Liang to fall apart

10:48.480 --> 10:49.480
the most?

10:53.041 --> 10:54.041
Liyang Royal Family.

10:56.281 --> 10:56.880
In their eyes,

10:57.000 --> 10:59.000
Huangman'er is a great tool
to break the balance.

11:00.201 --> 11:02.120
Wudang is but a martial-world sect.

11:02.961 --> 11:04.321
Can you cope with the royal power?

11:05.961 --> 11:07.081
Don't worry.

11:27.921 --> 11:30.241
Would they come here
to take him away by force?

11:41.441 --> 11:42.441
Sun Diaosi.

11:42.760 --> 11:45.576
(Zhao Fengya Princess Suizhu of Liyang)
Have you got the Xu brothers' traces?

11:45.600 --> 11:46.640
Your Grace,

11:47.640 --> 11:48.897
(Sun Diaosi, the eunuch)
Xu Fengnian

11:48.921 --> 11:49.760
and Xu Longxiang

11:49.880 --> 11:51.081
both left Lingzhou

11:52.000 --> 11:53.760
for Wudang one after another.

11:56.401 --> 11:58.801
(Mount Wudang)

12:03.201 --> 12:04.201
Okay.

12:06.201 --> 12:07.281
Let's go to Wudang as well.

12:09.240 --> 12:11.840
Three years ago, Xu Fengnian
broke off our betrothal,

12:12.561 --> 12:14.561
making me a laughing stock
in the capital city.

12:15.880 --> 12:17.321
How dare a son of a martial man

12:18.000 --> 12:19.401
humiliate the royal family?

12:23.000 --> 12:24.800
I'll pay the humiliation I had
three years ago

12:25.201 --> 12:26.720
back to him on Mount Wudang.

12:38.281 --> 12:39.401
The wimpy Taoist

12:39.760 --> 12:40.760
is gone?

12:41.720 --> 12:42.736
He was afraid of my punches.

12:42.760 --> 12:43.760
He sneaked off.

12:44.961 --> 12:46.321
What about your brother?

12:51.961 --> 12:53.241
He can't go back to North Liang,

12:53.720 --> 12:54.480
but I don't know

12:54.600 --> 12:55.281
where to put him

12:55.321 --> 12:56.721
to keep away from the royal family.

12:57.880 --> 12:59.120
Before I figure out a solution,

12:59.201 --> 13:00.201
I'll stay here in Wudang.

13:02.681 --> 13:04.081
I feel like

13:04.840 --> 13:06.000
there won't be a solution.

13:09.640 --> 13:10.640
I'll keep thinking.

13:13.240 --> 13:14.520
Is it true that the young Taoist

13:15.120 --> 13:16.801
will be the next Master of Wudang?

13:20.760 --> 13:21.760
Yes.

13:23.921 --> 13:25.600
Then why did you beat him right here?

13:25.880 --> 13:26.880
He owed me.

13:28.401 --> 13:29.401
Owed you what?

13:30.640 --> 13:31.640
He failed my sister.

13:33.760 --> 13:34.760
That young Taoist?

13:39.240 --> 13:40.480
My family often came to Wudang,

13:41.801 --> 13:43.000
and over time,

13:44.000 --> 13:46.480
my eldest sister started
to have feelings for the young Taoist.

13:48.000 --> 13:49.081
And then?

13:49.321 --> 13:50.321
Nothing particular.

13:51.760 --> 13:53.640
The young Taoist refused
to go down the mountain

13:53.961 --> 13:54.961
and my sister

13:55.161 --> 13:56.520
married someone in Jiangnan.

13:58.360 --> 14:00.137
Did he promise her
that he'd go down the mountain?

14:00.161 --> 14:00.961
Never.

14:01.161 --> 14:02.561
Then it wasn't his fault.

14:02.801 --> 14:03.840
Though he never said it,

14:04.041 --> 14:05.120
everybody could tell that

14:05.520 --> 14:06.921
he was into my sister.

14:09.000 --> 14:10.336
Since they had feelings for each other,

14:10.360 --> 14:11.640
how come they weren't together?

14:14.441 --> 14:15.600
Did his Master forbid him?

14:17.281 --> 14:18.801
He made a vow that

14:20.000 --> 14:21.600
before becoming the best martial artist,

14:21.801 --> 14:23.121
he wouldn't go down the mountain.

14:27.201 --> 14:28.401
Then he'll never

14:28.720 --> 14:30.480
be able to go down the mountain
in this life.

14:31.360 --> 14:33.201
And Sister refused
to get on the mountain.

14:36.240 --> 14:37.240
Forget it.

14:37.961 --> 14:38.961
It isn't important.

14:40.360 --> 14:42.480
What matters the most now
is Huangman'er.

14:43.321 --> 14:44.600
Before I work out a solution,

14:45.360 --> 14:46.960
I'm afraid
you'll have to stay here, too.

15:03.520 --> 15:04.880
Xu Fengnian.

15:08.321 --> 15:09.360
Little Jiang Ni?

15:11.681 --> 15:13.201
Is there something wrong with my ears?

15:23.961 --> 15:24.681
Xu.

15:25.600 --> 15:26.600
Feng.

15:48.600 --> 15:49.600
It is you.

15:50.561 --> 15:51.600
What are you doing here?

15:58.321 --> 15:59.321
Why don't you speak?

15:59.801 --> 16:00.801
You bad guy.

16:01.760 --> 16:02.760
What did I do?

16:03.600 --> 16:05.160
Do you have any idea how heavy this is?

16:05.201 --> 16:06.801
I carried it all the way
up the mountain.

16:08.161 --> 16:09.321
I'm exhausted.

16:10.281 --> 16:11.281
What is that?

16:11.720 --> 16:12.720
Clothes for change.

16:12.760 --> 16:13.777
Writing brushes, ink sticks,
paper, and inkstone.

16:13.801 --> 16:15.720
You came to Wudang without
any of them,

16:16.081 --> 16:17.880
and I had to carry all the stuff here.

16:19.041 --> 16:20.041
Xu Xiao guessed

16:20.120 --> 16:21.720
that I'd be living in Wudang
for a while.

16:22.441 --> 16:24.041
He knows you too well.

16:25.520 --> 16:26.520
Why did he send you here?

16:27.640 --> 16:29.201
He learned about me lending the horse.

16:29.640 --> 16:30.640
It was all your fault.

16:33.000 --> 16:34.081
You came up by yourself?

16:34.880 --> 16:37.000
The carriage only took me to
the foot of the mountain.

16:37.561 --> 16:38.561
You didn't go back?

16:43.640 --> 16:45.880
Xu Xiao asked you to look after me
in Wudang.

16:46.880 --> 16:48.081
You'll live a miserable life.

16:52.401 --> 16:53.880
Are you a dog?

16:59.880 --> 17:01.240
You two can have the room.

17:01.520 --> 17:02.840
I'll find a place to live myself.

17:03.000 --> 17:04.120
Call me if you have trouble.

17:04.281 --> 17:05.281
Sir.

17:30.880 --> 17:31.880
Too bad.

17:32.281 --> 17:33.281
There's no room

17:33.360 --> 17:35.360
for another bed.

17:39.561 --> 17:40.561
Fine.

18:26.961 --> 18:27.961
Your bed's ready.

18:57.800 --> 18:58.800
So comfortable.

19:07.361 --> 19:08.361
Are you sure?

19:10.080 --> 19:10.881
Do you really not need me

19:11.040 --> 19:12.040
to swap bed with you?

19:13.800 --> 19:14.800
No.

19:15.641 --> 19:17.241
You're just going to sit there
all night?

19:18.520 --> 19:19.961
I'm happy to.

19:24.080 --> 19:25.841
Your coin box is in the baggage, right?

19:43.520 --> 19:45.240
So comfortable.

22:32.681 --> 22:33.800
The pickle is pretty good.

22:35.800 --> 22:37.400
She slept like that for the whole night?

22:38.720 --> 22:39.800
She was probably exhausted.

22:40.201 --> 22:42.201
You didn't put her in bed?

22:43.361 --> 22:44.881
She's a poor girl.

22:47.121 --> 22:48.721
Then she needs to be taken care of more.

22:48.961 --> 22:50.441
She doesn't need to be taken care of

22:50.681 --> 22:51.681
or pitied.

22:52.361 --> 22:53.361
This girl

22:54.080 --> 22:55.080
is quite proud.

22:55.280 --> 22:57.320
Why didn't she sleep against the wall?

22:57.760 --> 22:58.760
The baggage is heavy.

22:59.320 --> 23:00.441
She carried it all the way

23:00.800 --> 23:01.800
on her shoulder.

23:02.040 --> 23:03.160
I'm afraid her skin is torn.

23:03.641 --> 23:05.241
It'd hurt her if she leaned on the wall.

23:06.280 --> 23:07.280
How do you know?

23:08.480 --> 23:09.480
She's my maid.

23:10.080 --> 23:11.560
Of course, I know.

23:12.280 --> 23:13.320
I don't get you.

23:17.480 --> 23:18.480
She's awake.

23:18.921 --> 23:19.921
Come and have breakfast.

23:34.921 --> 23:35.641
You keep eating.

23:35.760 --> 23:36.760
Don't mind her.

24:50.681 --> 24:51.681
What?

24:54.201 --> 24:55.201
Any vegetables?

25:01.201 --> 25:01.800
If these aren't enough,

25:01.921 --> 25:02.921
I'll fetch more.

25:03.881 --> 25:04.881
Live ones.

25:06.441 --> 25:07.560
Live food?

25:12.760 --> 25:13.881
Is this guy a fool?

25:14.760 --> 25:16.520
He'll be the next Master of Wudang.

25:18.401 --> 25:19.401
Your Highness,

25:20.080 --> 25:21.121
what did she mean?

25:22.320 --> 25:23.320
She was asking you

25:23.480 --> 25:25.040
if you have seeds or seedlings?

25:26.240 --> 25:27.401
How come they're alive?

25:28.760 --> 25:30.240
Before they get dug out of the earth,

25:30.401 --> 25:31.760
they're alive.

25:33.681 --> 25:34.480
You're right.

25:34.641 --> 25:35.641
They are alive.

25:36.760 --> 25:37.760
What are you going to do

25:38.240 --> 25:39.240
with these?

25:40.040 --> 25:41.040
To plant them.

25:43.000 --> 25:44.000
We've got vegetables.

25:44.560 --> 25:45.560
We can send them over.

25:47.000 --> 25:48.240
Can't I grow my own vegetables?

25:50.280 --> 25:51.280
You can,

25:51.641 --> 25:53.280
but we don't have
any seeds or seedlings.

25:56.720 --> 25:59.121
Where do you get the vegetables?

26:00.240 --> 26:02.280
We do have a vegetable garden.

26:06.641 --> 26:07.641
Take me there.

26:13.000 --> 26:14.000
Come on.

26:16.000 --> 26:16.641
Don't look at me.

26:16.720 --> 26:17.720
It's none of my business.

26:38.681 --> 26:42.761
(Wudang Main Hall)
(Sanqing Hall)

26:51.721 --> 26:55.001
(Sanqing Hall)

27:15.800 --> 27:16.800
Master.

27:16.841 --> 27:17.441
Master.

27:17.641 --> 27:18.801
If it isn't the garden chief?

27:19.161 --> 27:20.201
We've got a crisis.

27:20.401 --> 27:21.760
There were thieves.

27:23.040 --> 27:24.881
Many vegetables have been stolen.

27:25.441 --> 27:26.921
A thorough investigation is required.

27:27.201 --> 27:28.401
Who would steal vegetables?

27:32.280 --> 27:33.280
Could there be

27:33.881 --> 27:35.201
an overrun with rats in mountain?

27:36.921 --> 27:37.520
Master,

27:37.760 --> 27:39.720
they used shovels.

27:40.800 --> 27:42.760
Maybe there's a fox spirit.

27:45.320 --> 27:47.121
Just be more careful in the future.

27:48.201 --> 27:49.201
Go.

27:52.641 --> 27:53.641
Master,

27:54.080 --> 27:55.921
fox eats meat as opposed to vegetables.

27:57.240 --> 27:58.601
What is arcanum?

27:58.720 --> 27:59.720
Obtain its essence,

27:59.760 --> 28:00.881
and practice it.

28:01.361 --> 28:02.480
Prodigy utilizes it.

28:02.560 --> 28:03.720
Tools forget it.

28:04.121 --> 28:05.401
The profound meaning of it

28:05.961 --> 28:07.800
has to be comprehended by yourself.

28:07.961 --> 28:09.841
You can't ask me for every answer.

28:12.601 --> 28:13.601
Prodigy utilizes it.

28:14.240 --> 28:15.240
Tools forget it.

28:16.000 --> 28:17.080
Prodigy utilizes it.

28:18.201 --> 28:19.201
Tools forget it.

28:20.441 --> 28:21.441
Prodigy utilizes it.

28:22.560 --> 28:23.560
Tools forget it.

28:24.560 --> 28:25.560
Prodigy utilizes it.

28:27.040 --> 28:28.121
Tools forget it.

28:52.401 --> 28:53.401
Miss Jiang Ni,

28:54.240 --> 28:55.681
you mustn't let Master know

28:56.641 --> 28:57.681
that you stole

28:57.921 --> 28:58.921
the vegetables.

28:59.320 --> 29:00.441
I asked you to lead the way,

29:00.560 --> 29:01.720
and I dug the vegetables out.

29:02.280 --> 29:03.377
He can come and speak to me.

29:03.401 --> 29:04.601
It has nothing to do with you.

29:06.240 --> 29:07.680
Still, we'd better keep it a secret.

29:08.800 --> 29:09.800
Are you afraid of him?

29:10.000 --> 29:11.000
Would he hit you?

29:12.000 --> 29:13.000
My senior?

29:14.080 --> 29:15.080
He never hits me.

29:18.040 --> 29:19.280
Then why are you afraid of him?

29:37.121 --> 29:38.441
Who are they?

29:46.480 --> 29:47.920
Lead the orthodox Taoism of Santian.

29:49.480 --> 29:50.480
Mount Longhu.

29:57.240 --> 29:59.560
The No. 1 sect personally approved by
the Emperor.

30:29.280 --> 30:32.000
It's good to stay in Wudang.

30:33.841 --> 30:35.080
When I was in North Liang,

30:35.601 --> 30:37.161
I had to stay vigilant and suspicious

30:37.320 --> 30:38.520
all the time.

30:42.921 --> 30:44.560
But there's no meat, though.

30:44.881 --> 30:45.881
This is unbearable.

30:50.921 --> 30:51.921
Brother,

30:52.121 --> 30:52.720
come with me.

30:53.040 --> 30:53.480
What?

30:54.040 --> 30:55.040
Come on.

31:00.720 --> 31:01.201
Brother.

31:01.641 --> 31:02.641
This way.

31:06.201 --> 31:07.201
Where are you taking me?

31:07.760 --> 31:08.760
Here.

31:13.001 --> 31:16.937
(Purple Bamboo Forest)

31:16.961 --> 31:17.961
Is this where you live?

31:18.601 --> 31:19.040
Yeah.

31:19.520 --> 31:20.641
There's a cabin inside.

31:21.161 --> 31:22.240
Brother, give me a minute.

31:29.281 --> 31:31.401
(Purple Bamboo Forest)

32:08.800 --> 32:09.800
Brother.

32:11.040 --> 32:12.040
Brother, you're awake.

32:15.121 --> 32:16.361
Why did I sleep here?

32:17.921 --> 32:18.921
You didn't fall asleep.

32:19.240 --> 32:20.240
You passed out.

32:21.800 --> 32:22.800
Why did I pass out?

32:23.441 --> 32:25.281
A Taoist with the wooden sword
knocked you out.

32:25.641 --> 32:26.921
A Taoist with the wooden sword?

32:28.921 --> 32:29.320
The one

32:29.720 --> 32:30.960
who lives in the bamboo forest?

32:32.720 --> 32:33.840
He's a Wudang disciple, too?

32:34.520 --> 32:35.560
He didn't hit you, did he?

32:35.881 --> 32:36.401
No.

32:36.520 --> 32:38.600
The Wooden Sword Taoist
said I have a peaceful heart.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.200
What did he knock me out with?

32:42.681 --> 32:43.681
Sword energy.

32:44.201 --> 32:45.201
Sword energy?

32:46.520 --> 32:48.040
Is there such a genius in Wudang?

32:50.361 --> 32:51.361
Brother.

32:56.080 --> 32:57.080
Chicken thigh?

32:57.361 --> 32:58.361
Pheasant.

32:59.000 --> 33:00.000
Where did you get it?

33:00.520 --> 33:01.817
I caught one in the bamboo forest,

33:01.841 --> 33:02.841
and roasted it on fire.

33:02.881 --> 33:03.921
I left the thigh for you.

33:04.641 --> 33:06.601
The Wooden Sword Taoist
didn't see you, right?

33:07.320 --> 33:08.320
He saw me.

33:08.520 --> 33:09.520
He didn't stop you?

33:12.760 --> 33:14.961
I remember Wudang discipline
is quite strict.

33:15.520 --> 33:16.720
What kind of a Taoist is that?

33:17.720 --> 33:19.280
He's quite nice.

33:21.720 --> 33:22.720
You like this place?

33:25.361 --> 33:27.000
How about we stay here forever?

33:32.800 --> 33:33.800
No?

33:36.040 --> 33:37.040
You'll leave eventually.

33:37.280 --> 33:38.280
Where will I go?

33:38.720 --> 33:39.720
Home.

33:40.320 --> 33:41.320
Father said

33:41.520 --> 33:42.840
our home couldn't be without you.

33:45.520 --> 33:46.961
Both our sisters are gone,

33:47.760 --> 33:48.760
and you will leave, too.

33:49.560 --> 33:51.160
What's the point in me going home alone?

33:51.881 --> 33:53.201
Is that even a home anymore?

33:54.681 --> 33:55.881
Father wanted you to help him.

34:02.560 --> 34:03.560
Huangman'er,

34:05.681 --> 34:07.401
do you know why Xu Xiao

34:07.441 --> 34:08.441
sent you to Wudang?

34:09.280 --> 34:10.280
Yeah.

34:10.921 --> 34:11.921
What?

34:12.681 --> 34:13.800
To take away my strength.

34:15.720 --> 34:17.000
He told you this?

34:18.361 --> 34:19.361
Yes, he did.

34:19.921 --> 34:21.361
And you complied and came?

34:23.320 --> 34:24.720
Father said if I was strengthless,

34:25.520 --> 34:26.881
you'd be out of trouble.

34:31.401 --> 34:32.681
Can't believe you're so dumb.

34:33.881 --> 34:34.881
I don't mind being dumb,

34:35.121 --> 34:36.121
as long as you're smart.

34:37.401 --> 34:38.401
Eat the meat, Brother.

34:50.121 --> 34:51.121
Is it good?

34:52.080 --> 34:53.080
Yes.

35:01.121 --> 35:02.121
Huangman'er,

35:03.040 --> 35:04.080
I'm not afraid of trouble.

35:05.080 --> 35:06.520
I'll be right here safeguarding you.

35:07.080 --> 35:08.601
No one can take you away.

35:09.480 --> 35:10.641
I'm afraid you can't.

35:12.961 --> 35:13.961
Sir.

35:14.441 --> 35:16.121
How come I haven't seen you these days?

35:16.800 --> 35:18.400
I've been hanging around
in the mountain.

35:18.800 --> 35:20.080
You said I can't safeguard him?

35:20.240 --> 35:21.240
What did you mean?

35:22.000 --> 35:23.200
Mount Longhu sent people here.

35:23.921 --> 35:24.921
They came for him.

35:26.201 --> 35:26.760
Where are they?

35:27.000 --> 35:28.040
At the door of your house.

35:28.401 --> 35:29.401
That's quite a group.

35:31.320 --> 35:32.617
You return to the forest, Huangman'er.

35:32.641 --> 35:33.441
You mustn't come out

35:33.560 --> 35:34.560
unless I call you.

35:40.801 --> 35:41.801
Go.

35:51.040 --> 35:53.200
If I conflict with Mount Longhu,

35:54.000 --> 35:55.040
which side will you be on?

35:57.281 --> 35:57.921
I wanted to

35:58.040 --> 36:00.016
fight the No. 1 sect
in the martial world long ago.

36:00.040 --> 36:00.761
Thank you, sir.

36:01.000 --> 36:02.000
You're welcome.

36:02.321 --> 36:03.480
But keep in mind,

36:03.801 --> 36:06.120
Jian Jiuhuang only asked me
to protect you for two months.

36:06.560 --> 36:08.080
And it'll soon be due.

36:16.401 --> 36:19.441
(Lead the Orthodox Taoism of Santian
Enlighten All Lives in This Catastrophe)

36:41.921 --> 36:43.281
There are so many people watching.

36:44.000 --> 36:45.480
You're still growing your vegetables?

36:45.721 --> 36:46.921
They didn't come for me.

36:48.921 --> 36:49.921
Where is Hong Xixiang?

36:50.921 --> 36:52.321
Wang Chonglou took him away.

36:53.921 --> 36:54.937
It looks like Wudang is going to

36:54.961 --> 36:56.520
stay out of it.

37:02.841 --> 37:03.881
I'm Xu Fengnian.

37:04.401 --> 37:05.401
Who wants to see me?

37:19.201 --> 37:22.481
(Zhao Xituan Arch-Taoist of Mount Longhu)

37:25.000 --> 37:25.576
Master.

37:25.600 --> 37:26.458
(Sanqing Hall)

37:26.482 --> 37:28.160
Are you sure they are from Mount Longhu?

37:28.801 --> 37:30.921
Don't let them fool us.

37:32.401 --> 37:33.520
I saw with my own eyes that

37:35.000 --> 37:36.401
it was Zhao Xituan.

37:38.721 --> 37:41.002
Zhao Xituan, one of the four
Arch-Taoists of Mount Longhu?

37:41.241 --> 37:42.241
Indeed.

37:43.881 --> 37:44.881
Master,

37:44.961 --> 37:46.761
Mount Longhu is powerful.

37:47.000 --> 37:48.320
Their Arch-Taoist came in person.

37:48.480 --> 37:50.560
We can't take it lightly.

37:50.921 --> 37:51.961
Yes.

37:56.841 --> 37:57.841
Junior,

38:00.080 --> 38:01.080
what do you think?

38:03.841 --> 38:05.681
My opinion is, though our sect
is named Wudang,

38:06.281 --> 38:08.480
it doesn't mean we own
the entire Mount Wudang.

38:09.120 --> 38:10.281
We can't take it for our own.

38:10.560 --> 38:11.560
It's a big mountain,

38:12.560 --> 38:14.080
and they can take a tour if they like.

38:15.640 --> 38:17.680
That is, after all,
the Arch-Taoist of Mount Longhu.

38:18.160 --> 38:18.680
Yes.

38:18.961 --> 38:20.601
I don't care
if he's an Arch-aoist or not.

38:21.680 --> 38:23.361
He came for Xu Longxiang.

38:24.080 --> 38:25.361
It has nothing to do with us.

38:30.520 --> 38:31.520
That's right.

38:33.120 --> 38:34.560
No matter how big the trouble is,

38:35.441 --> 38:37.441
it has nothing to do with us.

38:38.881 --> 38:39.881
Master.

38:45.480 --> 38:46.560
Xu Fengnian?

38:47.000 --> 38:48.000
Yes, that's me.

38:49.281 --> 38:50.281
Where is Xu Longxiang?

38:50.321 --> 38:50.921
Get him out.

38:51.241 --> 38:52.241
I

38:52.480 --> 38:54.401
Am going to
take him back to Mount Longhu.

38:55.520 --> 38:56.600
Who are you?

38:57.281 --> 38:59.321
Zhao Xituan of Longhu.

39:00.600 --> 39:01.600
Zhao Xituan?

39:03.241 --> 39:04.881
So the Arch-Taoist is here.

39:05.961 --> 39:07.160
How can you stand here?

39:07.480 --> 39:08.921
I didn't greet you properly.

39:09.120 --> 39:09.721
Sir,

39:09.961 --> 39:10.961
let's talk inside.

39:11.680 --> 39:12.680
Where is Xu Longxiang?

39:12.961 --> 39:14.121
I'll go fetch him right away.

39:14.321 --> 39:16.081
Please get inside
and have a cup of warm tea.

39:16.761 --> 39:17.761
Okay.

39:24.921 --> 39:25.921
Are you a match for him?

39:28.321 --> 39:29.561
We'll find out after the fight.

39:30.200 --> 39:31.961
I'll draw his attention,

39:32.080 --> 39:32.801
and you go to his back

39:32.961 --> 39:34.040
then sneak attack him.

39:34.801 --> 39:36.361
He's the Arch-Taoist of Mount Longhu.

39:36.441 --> 39:37.480
I don't care.

39:37.560 --> 39:38.976
Anyone who schemes against my brother

39:39.000 --> 39:40.000
won't get away with it.

39:41.241 --> 39:43.321
What about all those Taoists over there?

39:43.921 --> 39:45.297
You put the knife against
the Arch-Taoist's neck,

39:45.321 --> 39:46.361
and what can they do?

39:47.040 --> 39:48.056
If you try to escalate it,

39:48.080 --> 39:49.320
Mount Longhu will make you pay.

39:49.480 --> 39:49.881
It's fine.

39:50.321 --> 39:52.201
We'll say the Master of Wudang
told us to do it.

39:53.281 --> 39:54.601
No matter how big the trouble is,

39:54.881 --> 39:56.361
let Wudang take the blame.

39:56.801 --> 40:00.000
This is Mount Wudang, isn't it?

40:19.560 --> 40:20.921
It's a humble house.

40:21.560 --> 40:23.241
Please forgive us, sir.

40:26.200 --> 40:27.200
Jiang Ni,

40:27.881 --> 40:29.361
clean the bench for the Arch-Taoist.

40:29.680 --> 40:30.680
So he can sit.

40:32.441 --> 40:33.801
It's more convenient sitting down.

40:38.721 --> 40:39.721
Please sit, Arch-Taoist.

40:42.560 --> 40:43.560
It is pretty windy.

40:43.961 --> 40:44.961
I'll close the door.

41:02.040 --> 41:03.520
You mentioned tea, right?

41:03.881 --> 41:05.241
Where's the tea?

41:07.721 --> 41:08.841
Where's the tea?

41:10.921 --> 41:11.921
Where's the tea?

41:12.881 --> 41:13.881
Tea…

41:22.080 --> 41:23.480
Now that we've got the tea leaves,

41:23.640 --> 41:25.000
how is the water looking?

41:26.160 --> 41:27.280
Did you put the pot on fire?

41:28.000 --> 41:29.000
I think I did.

41:33.040 --> 41:35.040
It'll take some time
for the water to boil.

41:48.281 --> 41:49.000
Your Highness,

41:49.120 --> 41:50.120
don't panic,

41:50.200 --> 41:51.200
and don't get me wrong.

41:51.480 --> 41:52.841
The reason why I came

41:53.040 --> 41:56.361
is that I'd like to take your brother
back to Mount Longhu.

41:58.881 --> 42:01.401
Well, I didn't get you wrong, then.

42:41.841 --> 42:42.520
No fighting. No fighting.

42:42.721 --> 42:43.761
I surrender.

42:45.640 --> 42:46.961
Why doesn't he call for help?

42:47.120 --> 42:48.520
His people will come to his aid.

42:48.961 --> 42:49.961
How do I know?

42:54.680 --> 42:56.120
Jian Jiuhuang asked me to come here.

42:58.281 --> 42:59.281
Old Huang?

44:56.841 --> 45:00.681
♪ The flower of pain ♪
